&lt;p class=&quot;cgHgbA nxe3IQ Xp24Nw&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;OYPEnA&quot;&gt;Our commitment to respect, transparency, and simplicity means you can trust us to always choose to do the right thing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cgHgbA nxe3IQ Xp24Nw&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;OYPEnA&quot;&gt;As a trusted partner for purpose-built AI and intelligent automation, we solve highly complex problems for our enterprise&amp;nbsp;customers and put their information to work to transform the way they do business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;OYPEnA&quot;&gt;Over 10,000 customers trust ABBYY, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;OYPEnA&quot;&gt;including many Fortune 500 ones. You will work on further developing a portfolio already containing client names such as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;OYPEnA&quot;&gt;DHL, Johnson &amp;amp; Johnson, FDA, DMV, PwC, KeyBank, Spotify, and H&amp;amp;R BLOCK.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an energetic and detail-oriented Demand Marketing Specialist to join our APAC marketing team on an 8-month maternity cover contract. In this role, you will play a critical part in driving demand generation efforts across the region, supporting the end-to-end execution of marketing campaigns, events, and other initiatives. If you thrive in a fast-paced environment, have a keen eye for detail, and are passionate about delivering high-quality marketing programs, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, coordinate, and execute ABBYY Ascend, 3rd party events, industry tradeshows, and webinars, ensuring alignment with overall business and marketing objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all event logistics, vendor coordination, speaker coordination, platform setup, post-event follow-up and on-site/off-site support to ensure seamless execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams to align event goals with broader marketing objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and analyze webinar performance to optimize future sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Execution:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support end-to-end execution of integrated email campaigns, including creating internal campaign briefs, content creation and performance tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to develop high-impact campaign assets that are compelling, on-brand, and tailored to the unique needs of the APAC audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop clear and concise campaign briefs for internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Invoice Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with external vendors, ensuring timely delivery of services and adherence to agreed-upon terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process invoices and ensure accurate tracking of marketing expenses, adhering to internal financial processes and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the finance team to ensure budget alignment and resolve any invoicing discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Tracking &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and report on the performance of campaigns and events, providing actionable insights to improve ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data-driven approaches to optimize marketing efforts and achieve demand generation goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams, including revenue, marketing operations, product marketing and external agencies to ensure alignment and successful execution of marketing initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in demand generation, event marketing, or a related marketing role, preferably within the IT or software industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing events, campaigns, and webinars end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in marketing tools and platforms (Salesforce, Zoom, Jasper &amp;amp; Hubspot).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attributes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter with a proactive approach to problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meticulous and detail-oriented, committed to delivering high-quality work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
