&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;cgHgbA nxe3IQ Xp24Nw PanoWQ&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;OYPEnA&quot;&gt;Join ABBYY and be part of a team that celebrates your unique work style. With flexible work options, a supportive team, and rewards that reflect your value, you can focus on what matters most – driving your growth, while fueling ours.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cgHgbA nxe3IQ Xp24Nw&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;OYPEnA&quot;&gt;Our commitment to respect, transparency, and simplicity means you can trust us to always choose to do the right thing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cgHgbA nxe3IQ Xp24Nw&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;OYPEnA&quot;&gt;As a trusted partner for purpose-built AI and intelligent automation, we solve highly complex problems for our enterprise&amp;nbsp;customers and put their information to work to transform the way they do business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;OYPEnA&quot;&gt;Over 10,000 customers trust ABBYY, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;OYPEnA&quot;&gt;including many Fortune 500 ones. You will work on further developing a portfolio already containing client names such as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;OYPEnA&quot;&gt;DHL, Johnson &amp;amp; Johnson, FDA, DMV, PwC, KeyBank, Spotify, and H&amp;amp;R BLOCK.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:261,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:261,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;HR Operations Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a key leadership role within ABBYY’s global Human Resources function, reporting directly to the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Director, Engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;. This role leads a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;global HR Operations team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, with primary accountability for U.S. HR operations and responsibility for driving alignment, consistency, and operational excellence across regions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role serves as the end-to-end owner of HR systems of record, including&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;HiBob&amp;nbsp;(HRIS)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Greenhouse (ATS)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, and is accountable for delivering scalable, compliant, and high-quality HR operations across the full employee lifecycle globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;While&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;deep expertise in U.S. HR operations is essential&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, this role also requires the ability to operate in a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;global environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, partnering with regional stakeholders to standardize processes while accommodating local requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;hands-on leadership role for a builder-operator&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;someone who can lead and develop a team while designing and implementing scalable processes, workflows, and automation. A key focus of the role is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;reducing manual intervention and building efficient, technology-enabled HR operations at scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
