&lt;li&gt;Experience with software implementation, technical troubleshooting, and delivering enterprise-scale solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with analytics platforms and advanced skills in MS Office Suite or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt;
